cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the papers it implements."
title: "pragdml: Pragmatic double machine learning with AI-learned representations"
abstract: >-
  A Python implementation of pragmatic DML with AI-learned representations:
  cross-fitted double machine learning with learned Riesz representers, star and
  convex aggregation over menus of pipelines, and omitted-information sensitivity
  analysis with root-n inference for the region endpoints.
type: software
authors:
